Package: visualR
Type: Package
Title: Distributed Residual and Palindrome Topological Runtime
Version: 0.4.0.9000
Date: 2026-08-09
Authors@R:
    person("lkh-cq", given = NULL, email = "lkh-cq@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: lkh-cq [aut, cre]
Maintainer: lkh-cq <lkh-cq@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: An R-first exploratory topology runtime with two coexisting
    execution hypotheses. The distributed residual reservoir gives multiple
    local samplers one immutable positioned field, jointly assigns draw rights
    under pipe budgets and node-side capacities, preserves sampled position
    relations, and atomically commits residual supply. The established
    palindrome runtime remains available for compact PAL storage, grammar,
    mapping-pack controlled materialization, CPU lane concurrency, closure,
    recursion experiments, packaging, and transport. Base R defines the
    executable reference semantics; alternate runtimes remain optional
    execution fabrics.
